an Digital Library."]}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"Moreover, Pergamos supports an open REST / JSON API for third-party application interoperability."}),(0,a.jsxs)("p",{children:["The material hosted in the platform is primarily ",(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"freely available"}),' to the general public, since "Pergamos" adopts'," ",(0,a.jsx)(ed.x,{href:"http://www.openaccess.gr/",newtab:!0,children:"open access"})," ","policies"," ",(0,a.jsx)("i",{children:"(except for material which is either subject to restrictions on archival and copyright or its author has requested the imposition of spatial or temporal restrictions)"}),". However, precisely because of the openness and interoperability of Pergamos, the metadata of digital objects and the actual digital material are easier to locate and become more known on the Internet."]}),(0,a.jsxs)("p",{children:["However, it is worth noting that, unless explicitly stated otherwise, access to the material (digital or not) contained in Pergamos and any use thereof (e.g. printing, storage, copying, etc.) is allowed ",(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"exclusively"})," for ",(0,a.jsx)("i",{children:"educational"}),", ",(0,a.jsx)("i",{children:"research"})," and"," ",(0,a.jsx)("i",{children:"private"})," purposes, but ",(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"not"})," for ",(0,a.jsx)("i",{children:"commercial"})," ones."]}),(0,a.jsxs)("p",{children:["In addition, any use of the material contained in Pergamos, should be accompanied by a reference to its origin and its permanent electronic link in the platform"," ",(0,a.jsx)("i",{children:"(aka Permalink or Persistent URL)"}),", as well as to the creator of the original item in the Repository."]}),(0,a.jsxs)("p",{children:['Summarizing the aforementioned, unless otherwise explicitly stated, the material provided in and by Pergamos, is generally available for use under the "',(0,a.jsx)(ed.x,{href:"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/",newtab:!0,children:"Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 In