e complete.'})},{question:(0,a.jsx)(a.Fragment,{children:"Can I permanently delete what I have saved so far?"}),answer:(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:'Yes. Select "Delete" at the top right of the submission form. The form is then permanently deleted, and you must start the entire process again.'})},{question:(0,a.jsx)(a.Fragment,{children:'What happens when I select "Submit"?'}),answer:(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"The system asks you to confirm that you want to submit your work finally."})},{question:(0,a.jsx)(a.Fragment,{children:"What should I do after finally submitting my work?"}),answer:(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"The relevant Library reviews your work to decide whether it can be approved or whether you need to correct the submission form. In either case, it will notify you at the email address you provided."})},{question:(0,a.jsx)(a.Fragment,{children:"Can the form be displayed in English?"}),answer:(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:'Yes. Select the "English" button at the top right of the page.'})},{question:(0,a.jsx)(a.Fragment,{children:"How will I know that my electronic deposit was submitted successfully?"}),answer:(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"You will receive a submission confirmation at the email address you provided. It includes the completed form."})},{question:(0,a.jsx)(a.Fragment,{children:"Will I receive an official confirmation from the Library if my submission is approved?"}),answer:(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"Yes. An email to the address you provided will confirm approval and include the relevant certificate as an attachment."})},{question:(0,a.jsx)(a.Fragment,{children:"I entered the wrong contact email. How can I correct it?"}),answer:(0,a.jsxs)(a.Fragment,{children:[(0,a.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"If you have not submitted your work yet,"})," delete the draft and start again with the correct email address. ",(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"If you have already submitted it, contact your Library"})," (",(0,a.jsx)(ed.x,{href:"http://www.lib.uoa.gr/bibliothikes-sch