llectual property rights or, otherwise, declare that uploading the material to Pergamos does not infringe any third party's rights."}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"I bear sole responsibility for any action that may give rise to legal issues as a result of the upload."}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"I declare that neither the Pergamos Institutional Repository and its administrators nor the institution to which the repository belongs, the National and Kapodistrian University of Athens, bear any responsibility for the upload or its content."}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"I confirm that, as the creator of the uploaded content, I am liable to NKUA for any related claim that a third party may bring."}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"I declare that the upload follows Pergamos' open-access policy, making the material available solely for personal study and private use, and for educational and research purposes. Third parties may not use the material for commercial purposes or for direct or indirect commercial gain."}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"I understand that, if the material being uploaded (a poster, article, book or book chapter) has already been published:"}),(0,a.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("li",{children:"If the digital material is available on the publisher's website, I will upload only the official URL pointing to the digital file, subject to the access rights granted by the publisher, or the digital file itself only if I have the right to do so under the applicable agreement or licence."}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{children:"If the work does not exist in digital form, I will upload a digital file that is not a digital reproduction of the original printed publication, unless the publisher has expressly agreed or I hold all intellectual property rights."})]}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"I understand that, if the material being uploaded (a poster, article, book, book chapter, preprint, technical report, etc.) has not been published, I have the right to upload the corresponding digital item."}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"\xa0I have read and fully understand the points in this declaration and accept any legal responsibility arising from it."})}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:(0,a.jsxs)("i",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"Please note"})," that this declaration is ",(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"common to and required for"})," every supported method of entry, whether manual or automated bulk import. It applies both to descriptive metadata and to digital material."]})})]})},{id:"step-2",title:"Step 2: Administrative metadata",stage:!1,body:(0,a.jsxs)(a.Fragment,{children:[(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"At this step, select:"}),(0,a.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("li",{children:"The language of the material (the language in which the paper, article, etc. is written)"}),(0,a.jsx)("li",{children:"The NKUA academic unit under which the material will be recorded (for example, an NKUA department)"})]}),(0,a.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"Check"})," the information you enter in these fields carefully. Once the material has been uploaded, you ",(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"cannot"})," change its ",(0,a.jsx)("i",{children:"language of description"})," or"," ",(0,a.jsx)("i",{children:"affiliation"}),". If either is wrong, you must ",(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"delete"})," the upload using the relevant button and create a new one."]})]})},{id:"step-3",title:"Step 3: Bibliographic record",stage:!1,body:(0,a.jsxs)(a.Fragment,{children:[(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"At this step, a form asks you to enter the descriptive metadata required for the material type selected in Step 1. Please note:"}),(0,a.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("li",{children:'Fields marked with an asterisk "*" are required.'}),(0,a.jsxs)("li",{children:["If the material has already been published (for example, an article, poster or book) and is available on a publisher's website, you may provide the ",(0,a.jsx)("b",{children:"URL"})," ","pointing to the digital file instead of uploading th